    "detailed_description": "20 kidnapped celebrities have been tasked with retrieving relics of unimaginable value to win back their freedom. Deadly threats await them around every turn. Either they escape with a relic or die trying. This is their last chance for survival. This is MIA.<br><br><strong>Early Access includes following features and content</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Character selection<br></li><li>Gunplay<br></li><li>(Online &amp; LAN) Matchmaking<br></li><li>Custom Games<br></li><li>An Island Map to play<br></li><li>Walkietalkie (Voice chat feature)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "20 kidnapped celebrities have been tasked with retrieving relics of unimaginable value to win back their freedom. Deadly threats await them around every turn. Either they escape with a relic or die trying. This is their last chance for survival. This is MIA.<br><br><strong>Early Access includes following features and content</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Character selection<br></li><li>Gunplay<br></li><li>(Online &amp; LAN) Matchmaking<br></li><li>Custom Games<br></li><li>An Island Map to play<br></li><li>Walkietalkie (Voice chat feature)</li></ul>",
